{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_028D50","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"“Bosque del Alba”意为“曙光之森”。这个名字果然是因为它位于东海岸。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":"JPN_NAME_ORIGIN_CAUSALITY_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"典型的热带雨林，也就是所谓的丛林。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"可惜，看来是见不到朝阳了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"是啊。茂密的树木挡住阳光，直射光照不到下面。可能不太好走……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"AUX_TRAVERSAL_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"没事。丛林的话，我以前可没少在里面转悠。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"JPN_PAST_WANDERING_PRIMARY"}]}